  "Nos artisans réalisent des ouvrages précis et soignés, conçus pour la solidité et la durée.": { en: "Our craftsmen create precise, carefully finished pieces, designed for strength and longevity.", it: "I nostri artigiani realizzano opere precise e curate, progettate per la solidità e la durata." },
  "Tout commence à l'atelier : conception, forge et pose": { en: "It all starts at the workshop: design, forging and installation", it: "Tutto comincia in officina: progettazione, forgiatura e posa" },
